            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg><span><strong>Visueller Editor</strong> – Workflows auf einen Blick verstehen</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg><span><strong>HTTP/API Module</strong> – Verbinde jede API ohne native Integration</span></li>
            <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg><span><strong>Data Stores</strong> – Daten zwischen Ausführungen speichern</span></li>
